The options are:

=over

=item C<address_sid>

Address Sid of customer to which the number will be ported.

=item C<target_account_sid>

Account Sid to which the number will be ported. This can be used to determine
if a sub account already has the number in its inventory or a different sub
account. If this is not provided, the authenticated account will be assumed to
be the target account.

=back

