=item country

Country the phone number belongs to.

=item not_portable_reason

Reason why the phone number cannot be ported into Twilio, C<null> otherwise.

=item not_portable_reason_code

The Portability Reason Code for the phone number if it cannot be ported into
Twilio, C<null> otherwise.

=item number_type

One of C<LOCAL>, C<UNKNOWN>, C<MOBILE> or C<TOLL-FREE>.

=item phone_number

The phone number which portability is to be checked. Phone numbers are in E.164
